{"product_id":"futurenext-re-imagining-our-world-conquering-uncertainty","title":"FutureNEXT: Re-imagining our world \u0026 conquering uncertainty","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Future Has Arrived Early. And It Is Challenging Each Of Us To Ask, And Answer, The Defining Questions Of Our Time: How Will Our Post-Pandemic Society Move Forward?Will We Ever Return To The World We Once Knew?Are We Witnessing The Development Of A New Socio-Economic System? Shaped By The Dynamic Approach Of Futures-Strategist John Sanei And The Profound Economic Thinking Of Dr Iraj Abedian, Futurenext Equips Readers With The Mindset And Tools Needed To Forge A New Way Forward - A Way Of Confidence And Peace Of Mind. The Book Explores Our Evolving Responsibilities As Consumers, Employees, Employers, Entrepreneurs And Executives Tasked With Re-Imagining Our World. In So Doing, It Provides A Path To Create Prosperous Societies That Are More Harmonious, Systematically Fair And Sustainable Than Anything We'Ve Known.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:11 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: John Sanei \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9798692623935 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43937635401881,"sku":"2RA9798692623935","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/64b5d5ec344b4c6966834bd015ebb74c.jpg?v=1709658697","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/futurenext-re-imagining-our-world-conquering-uncertainty","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}